# Copy to functions/.env (gitignored) and fill in a real value. Read
# server-side by adapters/placesApiAdapter.ts for the getPlaceRecommendations
# callable — the same Google Places API key already used client-side in
# apps/mobile/.env.local (AMIVA_GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY), just also loaded
# here so the Cloud Function can call Places Text Search directly.
AMIVA_GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
